  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Rural Development: Promotion of Resilient and Sustainable Agrifood Systems for Family Farming Programme</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">To facilitate rural transformation, achieve food security and reduce rural poverty through the social and economic inclusion and increasing resilience in poorest regional economies. Specific objective are: i) increasing adaptation to climate change, ii) reactivation of regional economies, iii) improved linkages among public policies, and iv) incorporation of technologies (financial, productive, and market), with a special focus on vulnerable rural population (youth, women, indigenous communities).</narrative>
  </description>
